              "content": "Creates a GL Code with a new trade, category, or location.\r\n            <br />Send the [GET /GlCodes/RetrieveGlCodes](/swagger/ui/index?version=3#/GlCodes/GETv3_GlCodes_RetrieveGlCodes_trade__trade__category__category__location__location_) request to get the list of GL Codes.",
